    {
      "id": "s08-insufficient-must-not-answer",
      "query": "哪个仓库的私有部署密钥轮换周期是多久？",
      "split": "holdout",
      "kind": "no_answer",
      "relevant": [],
      "stub_evidence": {
        "哪个仓库的私有部署密钥轮换周期是多久？": ["d-secret-rotation"]
