      },
      "script": ["ANSWER: fallback 停"],
      "expect": {"stop": "answer"}
    },
    {
      "id": "s10-gold-unreached-screening",
      "query": "首跳只召回噪声时，多跳问题还能答对吗？",
      "split": "holdout",
      "kind": "answer",
      "relevant": ["g-agentic-loop", "g-noise-1"],
      "gold_answer": "不能，首跳漏证据就没有可改写的依据",
      "stub_evidence": {
        "首跳只召回噪声时，多跳问题还能答对吗？": ["g-noise-1", "g-noise-2"]
      },
      "script": ["ANSWER: 不能，首跳漏证据就没有可改写的依据"],
      "expect": {"stop": "answer"}
